{"date":"2025-06-17","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_6e17cbf17901c45285308f214aa6946d","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1750152600,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-06-14","chunk":0,"id":"m_5ee608127c3cd87e02aa04e4f59d7ae5"}}},{"id":"m_0ba440e2be50b7c4e42d2712746926e2","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1750152637,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_151582fe1d27192badaabfc75d3ea286","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1750152674,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b48b5bbbdfb53296f926931a35ebd718","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1750152711,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2266054df08b9943c7d6f3c9d783c581","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1750152748,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b599da03500fc3b9486886cd38d289fa","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1750152785,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_d668646d0ad286b9d30865e38b358af0","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1750152822,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_6abc627f245c5f4d707fa1185cc4ede8","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1750152859,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b9b9d690548bc7635be8923fb79525de","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1750152896,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5c1c4ed67d8c7106f8a9e2a4ea205b90","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1750152933,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_3889498a0afd34d1817dbcee64601368","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1750152970,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_51ba80462282810cf4309ba36efd55c8","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1750153007,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_dcbb5b643f7280a0d344fda8a27bb58f","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1750153044,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_eac929a62a63084903811674ad99e023","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1750153081,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_58271a65caf0fc7c6b62e0765bdb202b","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1750153118,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_9fbf7cb80cbf8790077f7dbe9555c86e","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1750153155,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_e180361b17fe6c831f471b53a90c53fc","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1750153192,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_29ede000ad35f5371fc53c2be89fae1d","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1750153229,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6d222ef599340a6d236a604e72385788","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1750153266,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_0fe11417c8d1eec36241b3c60d2b72ad","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1750153303,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b62a914a77d8c5eb508727ea14987dd8","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1750153340,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_3a011b1bd0ac53445688a8bbf1f4dc46","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1750153377,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_334c9c738d0fdff28fba6bc0eaf65fd2","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1750153414,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_f1a54c12c0d43371af2af8593d862d57","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1750153451,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
